d of summer selloff season.</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"sec-icon\">◆</span> Levels That Matter</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SPY $760</strong> - Key resistance, break above targets $765 gap fill</li>\n<li><strong>QQQ $745</strong> - Critical level for tech momentum continuation</li>\n<li><strong>VIX 23</strong> - Sub-23 opens door for real risk-on move</li>\n<li><strong>IWM $285</strong> - Small cap support break would signal broader weakness</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n<p><em>Not a prediction. A preparation. Make your plan before the bell.</em></p>"
